OL,3,GNEWSATraders face uncertainty over
OL,4,Amarket move
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarket traders have said they face
OL,7,Funcertainty as they wait for a
OL,8,Ftemporary move after the approval of
OL,9,Fcontroversial refurbishment plans.
OL,11,FCambridge City Council approved plans
OL,12,Ffor a multi-million pound redevelopment
OL,13,Fof the market square earlier this
OL,14,Fmonth.
OL,16,FThe council said it was "committed" to
OL,17,Fkeeping open the market, which has
OL,18,Foperated since the Middle Ages, but
OL,19,Ftraders are still waiting to hear where
OL,20,Fthey will be moved to.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
